---
// 소식 목록 (/[lang]/news). 최신순, 제목이 양쪽 언어 모두 비면 건너뛴다.
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/base-layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../../../components/page-header.astro";
import Section from "../../../components/section.astro";
import { news, byDateDesc, localizedText } from "../../../lib/content";
import { localePaths, useTranslations, withLocale, type Locale } from "../../../i18n/utils";

export const getStaticPaths = localePaths;

const lang = Astro.params.lang as Locale;
const t = useTranslations(lang);

const items = byDateDesc(news)
  .map((n) => ({ slug: n.slug, date: n.date, title: localizedText(n, "title", lang) }))
  .filter((n) => n.title);

const fmtDate = (d: string) =>
  new Date(d).toLocaleDateString(lang === "ko" ? "ko-KR" : "en-US", {
    year: "numeric",
    month: "short",
    day: "numeric",
  });
---

<BaseLayout lang={lang} title={t("nav.news")}>
  <PageHeader title={t("nav.news")} lede={t("news.lede")} />

  <Section>
    <ul class="divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
      {
        items.map((n) => (
          <li>
            <a
              href={withLocale(lang, `/news/${n.slug}`)}
              class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-4"
            >
              <time datetime={n.date} class="shrink-0 text-sm text-ink-muted">
                {fmtDate(n.date)}
              </time>
              <span class="font-medium text-ink underline-offset-2 group-hover:text-brand group-hover:underline">
                {n.title}
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
